two cases (2011, 2006, though no information in the 2002 case); so I
had a peek into the source. The yendor.dat file defines three random
demons on the respective Wizard tower levels. Inspecting the yacc file
(lev_comp.y, line 832 ff) and lev_main.c, get_monster_id(), it _seems_
that there's no check for implemented for the flag that is protecting
the generation. But I am really not sure whether that check maybe is
